WEBVTT

00:00:00.079 --> 00:00:22.359
[ Watch on kissFlix.co ]

00:00:23.879 --> 00:00:24.399
Look.

00:00:25.760 --> 00:00:27.079
I drew your little flower.

00:00:38.520 --> 00:00:39.079
How's that?

00:00:41.359 --> 00:00:42.320
Draw one for me too.

00:01:33.760 --> 00:01:34.359
The sun.

00:01:38.920 --> 00:01:42.079
A sunflower.

00:04:01.640 --> 00:04:05.080
=Ren Yu=

00:04:05.080 --> 00:04:07.280
(Adapted from Lei Mi's novel Ren Yu)

00:04:07.280 --> 00:04:10.240
=Episode 15=

00:04:20.639 --> 00:04:21.279
Dongchen!

00:04:22.519 --> 00:04:23.720
Shoes! Again.

00:04:23.759 --> 00:04:24.879
I need to talk to him.

00:04:25.120 --> 00:04:26.360
The guy tailing that old cop

00:04:26.399 --> 00:04:27.160
just called.

00:04:27.240 --> 00:04:28.720
He never went to security training.

00:04:29.000 --> 00:04:29.759
Sent someone else.

00:04:30.040 --> 00:04:31.519
Then snuck into the police station.

00:04:32.120 --> 00:04:33.439
He went to the police?

00:04:35.959 --> 00:04:36.439
How?

00:04:36.439 --> 00:04:37.439
Is this how you people do things?

00:04:37.480 --> 00:04:39.199
I paid all that and he won't come?

00:04:42.199 --> 00:04:43.160
Try something else.

00:04:43.800 --> 00:04:44.879
Whatever it takes,

00:04:44.920 --> 00:04:46.680
get Gu out of here.

00:05:09.959 --> 00:05:10.519
No.

00:05:11.480 --> 00:05:12.959
I have to send Na abroad.

00:05:15.240 --> 00:05:16.519
Whether she likes it or not.

00:05:17.079 --> 00:05:18.920
Pack her things. Get the papers done.

00:05:28.639 --> 00:05:29.279
You're back.

00:05:29.279 --> 00:05:30.279
Yeah.

00:06:05.279 --> 00:06:06.160
Heading out again?

00:06:06.920 --> 00:06:08.680
Going to check those sewers, right?

00:06:10.199 --> 00:06:11.040
Eat your noodles.

00:06:13.399 --> 00:06:14.279
I'll eat later.

00:06:14.600 --> 00:06:15.120
Then I'll toss it.

00:06:15.600 --> 00:06:16.639
Fine, fine. Give me that.

00:06:17.800 --> 00:06:18.439
I'll eat.

00:06:24.720 --> 00:06:27.120
Those tunnels are a maze.

00:06:27.240 --> 00:06:28.079
You insist on going.

00:06:28.079 --> 00:06:29.040
I can't stop you.

00:06:29.279 --> 00:06:31.199
But don't you dare go down hungry.

00:06:31.480 --> 00:06:32.759
That's just

00:06:32.759 --> 00:06:33.519
asking to die.

00:06:34.000 --> 00:06:35.279
Wanna drive me crazy?

00:06:35.639 --> 00:06:36.680
I'm eating, aren't I?

00:06:36.800 --> 00:06:37.399
Still mad?

00:06:38.199 --> 00:06:39.399
Because you never listen.

00:06:42.079 --> 00:06:42.680
I'm off.

00:06:43.199 --> 00:06:44.000
Where are you going?

00:06:44.360 --> 00:06:45.199
Meeting someone.

00:07:19.920 --> 00:07:20.319
Let's go.

00:09:20.960 --> 00:09:23.279
Xiaolan, don't cry.

00:09:30.600 --> 00:09:31.159
Don't cry.

00:09:34.919 --> 00:09:35.559
No crying.

00:09:38.159 --> 00:09:38.919
I didn't cry.

00:10:21.000 --> 00:10:24.120
And to have the hope of
knowing the happiness

00:10:24.159 --> 00:10:28.080
of that glorious world above the stars.

00:10:28.879 --> 00:10:35.080
"You must not think of that,"
said the old woman.

00:10:35.960 --> 00:10:39.600
We feel ourselves to be much happier

00:10:39.720 --> 00:10:41.759
and much better off

00:10:41.759 --> 00:10:43.480
than human beings.

00:10:49.200 --> 00:10:49.879
Mr. Zhou.

00:10:50.639 --> 00:10:51.639
Let's do it again.

00:10:52.519 --> 00:10:53.159
Mr. Zhou.

00:10:53.519 --> 00:10:54.279
We've run this part

00:10:54.279 --> 00:10:55.720
five or six times already.

00:10:56.000 --> 00:10:56.840
Can't we start?

00:10:58.120 --> 00:10:59.039
Let's just do

00:10:59.159 --> 00:11:00.440
without the Little Mermaid

00:11:00.600 --> 00:11:01.360
and get started.

00:11:05.120 --> 00:11:05.720
The thing is,

00:11:06.080 --> 00:11:07.559
we're missing class

00:11:07.639 --> 00:11:08.480
to rehearse.

00:11:08.639 --> 00:11:09.919
The contest is almost here.

00:11:10.080 --> 00:11:11.200
Every minute counts.

00:11:11.919 --> 00:11:13.360
Exactly. It's almost here.

00:11:14.440 --> 00:11:15.840
That's why Ma Na has to be here.

00:11:16.240 --> 00:11:17.360
Mr. Zhou.

00:11:18.039 --> 00:11:19.600
Ma Na isn't the only one missing.

00:11:19.639 --> 00:11:20.639
Jiang Ting's absent too.

00:11:20.799 --> 00:11:21.279
Right.

00:11:21.720 --> 00:11:23.320
She's holding us up too.

00:11:23.519 --> 00:11:26.000
Is the contest called Maid C?

00:11:26.840 --> 00:11:28.519
Ma Na is the Little Mermaid.

00:11:29.159 --> 00:11:30.320
If she's not here,

00:11:30.879 --> 00:11:31.919
who can replace her?

00:11:32.039 --> 00:11:32.799
But, Mr. Zhou-

00:11:32.799 --> 00:11:33.360
Zhao Lingling.

00:11:36.399 --> 00:11:38.000
Mr. Zhou, don't worry yet.

00:11:38.279 --> 00:11:39.480
Both girls are absent.

00:11:39.679 --> 00:11:40.679
Maybe they're together.

00:11:41.039 --> 00:11:42.039
I'll call

00:11:42.039 --> 00:11:42.879
their parents now.

00:11:54.639 --> 00:11:55.000
Hello?

00:11:55.200 --> 00:11:56.720
Is this Jiang Ting's parent?

00:11:57.799 --> 00:11:58.240
Yes.

00:11:58.639 --> 00:11:59.559
I'm from her school.

00:11:59.720 --> 00:12:00.559
I'm calling because

00:12:00.639 --> 00:12:02.159
Jiang Ting isn't here today.

00:12:02.159 --> 00:12:03.360
She didn't call out either.

00:12:03.519 --> 00:12:04.600
Do you know why?

00:12:05.200 --> 00:12:06.639
She didn't go to school?

00:12:06.960 --> 00:12:07.440
Right.

00:12:07.679 --> 00:12:08.799
And another student...

00:12:10.919 --> 00:12:11.759
Who?

00:12:12.440 --> 00:12:13.039
Ma Na.

00:12:14.320 --> 00:12:16.840
(I saw Ma Na almost hit Jiang Ting.)

00:12:18.519 --> 00:12:19.240
Got it.

00:12:19.679 --> 00:12:20.639
I'm coming right now.

00:12:22.679 --> 00:12:23.799
So that's all true?

00:12:26.200 --> 00:12:28.200
That's all I know.

00:12:28.519 --> 00:12:29.759
That's all I'm sure of.

00:12:30.440 --> 00:12:31.679
If that's true,

00:12:33.039 --> 00:12:34.200
what Ma Na did to Jiang Ting

00:12:34.919 --> 00:12:36.200
and to Su Lin,

00:12:37.080 --> 00:12:38.559
that's more than just bullying.

00:12:39.440 --> 00:12:40.879
It's serious.

00:12:43.080 --> 00:12:43.759
So

00:12:44.120 --> 00:12:45.600
when you said they were both absent,

00:12:45.639 --> 00:12:46.720
that's what worried me.

00:12:47.360 --> 00:12:48.120
I get it.

00:12:48.919 --> 00:12:49.320
Well.

00:12:50.080 --> 00:12:51.360
Let's check every place we can.

00:12:51.679 --> 00:12:52.279
Look for them.

00:12:53.240 --> 00:12:54.200
Once their parents come,

00:12:54.440 --> 00:12:55.559
we'll work it out.

00:12:56.919 --> 00:12:57.759
Don't overthink it.

00:12:58.679 --> 00:13:00.480
Maybe it's just a coincidence.

00:13:02.360 --> 00:13:03.360
Go change.

00:13:03.720 --> 00:13:04.480
I'll wait here.

00:13:04.799 --> 00:13:05.480
Okay, sir.

00:13:18.360 --> 00:13:18.840
Hello?

00:13:24.120 --> 00:13:25.159
Ma Na skipped school?

00:13:27.559 --> 00:13:28.240
Okay, okay.

00:13:28.279 --> 00:13:28.759
Thank you.

00:13:39.039 --> 00:13:39.440
Hello?

00:13:39.519 --> 00:13:39.960
Bro.

00:13:40.159 --> 00:13:41.080
I saw Gu

00:13:41.320 --> 00:13:42.519
enter the towel factory.

00:13:43.480 --> 00:13:44.080
Got it.

00:14:33.759 --> 00:14:34.360
Hey!

00:14:34.639 --> 00:14:35.399
Seen Ma Na?

00:14:35.559 --> 00:14:36.279
No.

00:14:36.879 --> 00:14:37.519
Duan Hongjiang.

00:14:37.720 --> 00:14:38.399
Seen Ma Na?

00:14:38.399 --> 00:14:38.799
No.

00:14:39.360 --> 00:14:40.000
Quick question.

00:14:40.360 --> 00:14:41.600
Seen Ma Na from our class?

00:14:42.519 --> 00:14:43.000
Hey!

00:14:43.320 --> 00:14:45.039
Seen Ma Na from Hospitality?

00:14:45.039 --> 00:14:45.679
Or Jiang Ting?

00:14:45.879 --> 00:14:46.639
No.

00:14:47.759 --> 00:14:48.360
Knock it off.

00:14:48.799 --> 00:14:50.840
Seen Ma Na from Hospitality?

00:14:51.080 --> 00:14:51.679
No.

00:14:57.039 --> 00:14:57.440
Any luck?

00:14:57.440 --> 00:14:57.799
Mr. Zhou.

00:14:58.919 --> 00:15:00.120
The field? The school store?

00:15:00.159 --> 00:15:00.759
Did you check?

00:15:00.840 --> 00:15:01.799
Everywhere.

00:15:03.679 --> 00:15:05.639
Ms. Wang called

00:15:05.759 --> 00:15:06.879
both girls' parents.

00:15:07.000 --> 00:15:07.919
Neither went home.

00:15:08.000 --> 00:15:08.559
Mr. Zhou.

00:15:09.200 --> 00:15:11.240
Shouldn't we look for Ma Na first?

00:15:11.639 --> 00:15:13.279
Jiang Ting might be with her.

00:15:14.799 --> 00:15:15.320
Good point.

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:17.480
Jiang Ting doesn't cut class.

00:15:25.080 --> 00:15:25.960
Mr. Gu.

00:15:29.279 --> 00:15:30.120
You wait me here?

00:15:30.559 --> 00:15:31.360
This won't work.

00:15:31.399 --> 00:15:31.919
It'll snap.

00:15:31.960 --> 00:15:32.879
I used this last time.

00:15:34.519 --> 00:15:34.960
Let me.

00:15:35.200 --> 00:15:35.840
I got it.

00:15:45.279 --> 00:15:46.039
This works.

00:15:50.320 --> 00:15:50.840
Thanks.

00:15:51.559 --> 00:15:52.759
But I need to borrow it.

00:15:53.279 --> 00:15:54.360
When I come back up,

00:15:54.720 --> 00:15:56.200
I need to put the cover back.

00:15:58.679 --> 00:15:59.799
What's with the outfit?

00:16:00.559 --> 00:16:01.480
You're coming with me?

00:16:01.480 --> 00:16:02.480
Yeah.

00:16:03.720 --> 00:16:04.200
No.

00:16:04.960 --> 00:16:05.919
It's dangerous.

00:16:06.320 --> 00:16:07.840
If your mom knew,

00:16:08.000 --> 00:16:08.799
she'd worry sick.

00:16:09.200 --> 00:16:10.240
She's at work.

00:16:10.240 --> 00:16:11.200
She won't know.

00:16:11.279 --> 00:16:12.480
Doesn't matter.

00:16:12.879 --> 00:16:13.799
I promised her

00:16:14.159 --> 00:16:15.320
you'd stay out of this.

00:16:15.759 --> 00:16:16.360
Go home.

00:16:19.559 --> 00:16:19.960
Fine.

00:16:20.840 --> 00:16:21.720
You little.

00:16:22.600 --> 00:16:23.879
If you don't go, neither do I.

00:16:24.840 --> 00:16:25.960
I'll sit right here.

00:16:27.200 --> 00:16:27.840
Till she comes

00:16:27.840 --> 00:16:28.960
and takes you home.

00:16:32.120 --> 00:16:33.559
If I find anything,

00:16:33.600 --> 00:16:34.559
I'll tell you.

00:16:38.519 --> 00:16:39.080
Go home.

00:16:42.440 --> 00:16:44.120
Okay.

00:16:48.480 --> 00:16:48.879
Go.

00:17:44.200 --> 00:17:46.039
I told you not to come down.

00:17:46.200 --> 00:17:46.960
Easy.

00:17:50.759 --> 00:17:51.279
Easy.

00:17:54.599 --> 00:17:55.400
Another one.

00:17:58.319 --> 00:17:59.319
Thanks, Mr. Gu.

00:18:00.160 --> 00:18:01.559
Why won't you listen?

00:18:02.119 --> 00:18:02.799
Mr. Gu.

00:18:03.359 --> 00:18:04.680
Please let me come.

00:18:06.240 --> 00:18:07.200
I brought this too.

00:18:08.759 --> 00:18:09.599
Hold this.

00:18:12.880 --> 00:18:14.440
It's my dad's fishing line.

00:18:14.880 --> 00:18:16.079
You thought of everything.

00:18:17.279 --> 00:18:17.920
Give it here.

00:18:20.720 --> 00:18:22.960
Then let me help find Su Lin.

00:18:25.359 --> 00:18:26.920
Please, Mr. Gu.

00:18:27.000 --> 00:18:28.160
Let me come.

00:18:28.920 --> 00:18:30.640
I really want to help Su Lin.

00:18:33.160 --> 00:18:33.759
Look.

00:18:37.079 --> 00:18:37.440
This...

00:18:41.599 --> 00:18:42.319
Scared?

00:18:43.079 --> 00:18:43.799
No.

00:18:45.079 --> 00:18:46.119
I've been here before.

00:18:46.839 --> 00:18:48.240
Even if you don't take me,

00:18:48.680 --> 00:18:49.759
I'll come down on my own.

00:18:52.640 --> 00:18:53.720
Stay right behind me.

00:18:55.039 --> 00:18:56.119
Don't wander off.

00:18:56.440 --> 00:18:57.079
Got it?

00:18:59.440 --> 00:19:00.160
Give me the line.

00:19:08.279 --> 00:19:08.960
Mr. Gu.

00:19:10.559 --> 00:19:11.799
Which way do we go?

00:19:18.039 --> 00:19:19.799
Where did you find Su Lin's key?

00:19:20.359 --> 00:19:21.480
Around there.

00:19:23.559 --> 00:19:24.839
Then we'll go this way.

00:19:25.799 --> 00:19:26.599
Try our luck.

00:19:27.759 --> 00:19:29.119
Watch your step. It's slippery.

00:19:30.279 --> 00:19:31.079
Stay close.

00:19:31.559 --> 00:19:32.119
Okay.

00:20:00.839 --> 00:20:02.720
(Look what you did to your new shoes.)

00:20:02.880 --> 00:20:04.839
(Money doesn't grow on trees.)

00:20:05.720 --> 00:20:07.240
(Your dad works hard for it.)

00:20:07.240 --> 00:20:09.119
(You never think about that.)

00:20:20.359 --> 00:20:21.039
Dad, look!

00:20:21.160 --> 00:20:21.720
Cool, huh?

00:20:21.720 --> 00:20:22.440
Sure is.

00:20:22.680 --> 00:20:24.519
That's my boy!

00:20:24.599 --> 00:20:25.519
It's so windy.

00:20:26.599 --> 00:20:28.240
Put his jacket on.

00:20:28.559 --> 00:20:29.759
Coming!

00:20:29.799 --> 00:20:30.680
Put this on.

00:20:31.119 --> 00:20:31.920
Cold?

00:20:32.119 --> 00:20:32.839
No.

00:20:33.240 --> 00:20:34.039
Take a break, son.

00:20:34.240 --> 00:20:34.920
Put it on.

00:20:34.920 --> 00:20:35.880
Come on.

00:20:36.920 --> 00:20:37.799
Don't catch a cold.

00:20:39.119 --> 00:20:40.119
- No colds.
- Right.

00:20:40.799 --> 00:20:41.519
Honey.

00:20:41.559 --> 00:20:42.960
He's gotten taller.

00:20:47.319 --> 00:20:48.920
Want a fried egg?

00:21:05.359 --> 00:21:06.200
Vincent.

00:21:10.839 --> 00:21:12.839
Vincent! Vincent!

00:21:18.839 --> 00:21:19.559
What happened?

00:21:20.440 --> 00:21:21.640
How'd you get hurt so bad?

00:21:22.680 --> 00:21:23.240
Vincent.

00:21:24.720 --> 00:21:25.240
Vincent.

00:21:28.240 --> 00:21:28.680
Easy.

00:21:29.000 --> 00:21:29.519
Be careful.

00:21:31.920 --> 00:21:33.319
Come on, sit down.

00:21:33.480 --> 00:21:34.000
Right here.

00:21:34.160 --> 00:21:34.599
Sit.

00:21:36.680 --> 00:21:37.599
I'll get the alcohol.

00:21:46.920 --> 00:21:48.400
How'd you get so hurt?

00:21:56.599 --> 00:21:57.079
Here.

00:21:57.480 --> 00:21:58.200
Let me see.

00:22:02.680 --> 00:22:03.640
Don't move.

00:22:03.839 --> 00:22:04.960
I'll be gentle.

00:22:08.759 --> 00:22:09.319
Relax.

00:22:14.359 --> 00:22:15.599
Where did you go?

00:22:16.480 --> 00:22:18.160
How'd you get hurt this bad?

00:22:18.400 --> 00:22:19.880
East.

00:22:20.680 --> 00:22:21.960
Why'd you go east?

00:22:22.359 --> 00:22:23.720
That's someone else's territory.

00:22:33.559 --> 00:22:34.400
What's this?

00:23:15.160 --> 00:23:15.880
Vincent.

00:23:18.599 --> 00:23:19.880
Don't go east again.

00:23:23.440 --> 00:23:24.799
And no more fighting.

00:23:36.319 --> 00:23:36.960
Thank you.

00:23:39.839 --> 00:23:40.720
Thank you so much.

00:23:52.799 --> 00:23:53.920
I love this gift.

00:23:55.480 --> 00:23:56.720
I'll keep it safe.

00:23:58.559 --> 00:23:59.319
Xiaolan.

00:23:59.759 --> 00:24:01.160
Don't cry.

00:24:01.319 --> 00:24:02.160
Xiaolan.

00:24:03.119 --> 00:24:03.720
Smile.

00:24:05.039 --> 00:24:05.880
Xiaolan.

00:24:07.319 --> 00:24:08.599
Don't cry.

00:24:10.079 --> 00:24:11.160
Xiaolan.

00:24:14.000 --> 00:24:14.480
Smile.

00:24:16.400 --> 00:24:17.039
Xiaolan.

00:24:18.799 --> 00:24:19.319
Smile.

00:24:25.559 --> 00:24:27.039
She seemed fine this morning.

00:24:27.319 --> 00:24:28.039
She felt fine.

00:24:28.079 --> 00:24:29.400
- Yes. She...
- Right.

00:24:30.200 --> 00:24:32.119
Is Ms. Wang here?

00:24:32.759 --> 00:24:33.839
Hi, that's me.

00:24:35.359 --> 00:24:37.480
Ms. Wang, I'm Ma Na's guardian.

00:24:37.759 --> 00:24:39.279
Her dad just called.

00:24:39.440 --> 00:24:40.640
Said Ma Na never showed.

00:24:41.440 --> 00:24:43.119
Right. You're her mother?

00:24:43.640 --> 00:24:44.720
I'm her stepmother.

00:24:45.839 --> 00:24:47.599
Her mom died when she was little.

00:24:48.079 --> 00:24:48.599
That's okay.

00:24:48.799 --> 00:24:49.720
You're her guardian.

00:24:50.240 --> 00:24:51.440
Here's the situation.

00:24:52.200 --> 00:24:54.400
Ma Na and Jiang Ting are both absent.

00:24:54.720 --> 00:24:56.599
They're both on the recitation team.

00:24:56.960 --> 00:24:58.000
So I thought

00:24:58.200 --> 00:24:59.519
I'd contact both of you,

00:24:59.640 --> 00:25:00.720
so we can look together.

00:25:00.920 --> 00:25:02.599
Neither came to school?

00:25:03.200 --> 00:25:04.200
Didn't enter the gate?

00:25:04.839 --> 00:25:05.279
Right.

00:25:05.400 --> 00:25:07.440
We asked other students.

00:25:07.720 --> 00:25:09.359
Looks like neither showed up.

00:25:09.759 --> 00:25:10.599
We've searched

00:25:10.640 --> 00:25:12.480
the whole school

00:25:13.079 --> 00:25:13.839
and found nothing.

00:25:14.519 --> 00:25:16.319
If neither came,

00:25:17.759 --> 00:25:18.839
where could they be?

00:25:20.599 --> 00:25:21.759
Maybe they're not together.

00:25:22.839 --> 00:25:23.519
See,

00:25:23.799 --> 00:25:24.400
Ma Na

00:25:24.440 --> 00:25:26.160
argued with her dad last night.

00:25:26.799 --> 00:25:28.559
She may still be mad at him,

00:25:28.839 --> 00:25:29.720
so she skipped school.

00:25:30.559 --> 00:25:32.400
Don't panic yet.

00:25:32.920 --> 00:25:34.839
Think where they might go.

00:25:35.160 --> 00:25:37.519
Let's exchange numbers.

00:25:37.759 --> 00:25:39.559
Call as soon as anyone hears something.

00:25:40.160 --> 00:25:40.720
Ms. Wang,

00:25:41.240 --> 00:25:42.559
here's my home number.

00:25:43.000 --> 00:25:43.720
If I'm off work,

00:25:43.720 --> 00:25:44.440
I'm home.

00:25:44.920 --> 00:25:46.359
Call anytime.

00:25:46.680 --> 00:25:47.319
Okay.

00:25:47.640 --> 00:25:48.960
Try not to worry.

00:25:49.200 --> 00:25:49.880
Thank you.

00:26:12.559 --> 00:26:13.599
We're out of fishing line.

00:26:14.559 --> 00:26:15.559
Get me another spool.

00:26:15.640 --> 00:26:16.200
Okay.

00:26:21.440 --> 00:26:22.160
Mr. Gu.

00:26:24.200 --> 00:26:24.720
Here.

00:26:32.680 --> 00:26:33.240
What is it?

00:26:34.640 --> 00:26:36.400
Something crawled over my foot.

00:26:43.400 --> 00:26:44.079
Don't be scared.

00:26:45.400 --> 00:26:46.319
Probably a rat.

00:26:58.160 --> 00:26:59.359
I should take you back.

00:27:00.359 --> 00:27:00.839
No.

00:27:02.160 --> 00:27:03.200
Let's go, Mr. Gu.

00:27:05.799 --> 00:27:06.519
I'm fine.

00:27:28.680 --> 00:27:29.240
Be good.

00:27:29.720 --> 00:27:30.240
Put it on.

00:27:31.839 --> 00:27:32.920
What about you?

00:27:33.279 --> 00:27:34.880
Wear it or I'm taking you back.

00:27:47.359 --> 00:27:48.119
Mr. Gu.

00:27:49.400 --> 00:27:50.440
Could Su Lin

00:27:50.480 --> 00:27:51.920
have left us a clue here?

00:27:52.480 --> 00:27:54.720
Since she disappeared,

00:27:55.640 --> 00:27:57.559
we've had several downpours.

00:27:59.039 --> 00:27:59.839
Look at this wall.

00:28:00.480 --> 00:28:01.880
When it pours,

00:28:02.480 --> 00:28:03.720
the water gets this high.

00:28:04.759 --> 00:28:06.559
Even if she left a mark,

00:28:07.279 --> 00:28:08.519
after all that rain,

00:28:09.720 --> 00:28:11.559
it'd be long gone.

00:28:31.240 --> 00:28:31.720
Dongchen.

00:28:32.400 --> 00:28:33.319
Bro, here.

00:28:40.160 --> 00:28:41.160
They went down here.

00:28:41.160 --> 00:28:42.160
Yeah.

00:28:42.200 --> 00:28:43.039
I saw it clearly.

00:28:43.119 --> 00:28:43.720
A woman too.

00:28:44.200 --> 00:28:44.839
Right here.

00:28:48.960 --> 00:28:50.079
Wait in the car.

00:28:51.480 --> 00:28:51.880
Okay.

00:28:52.240 --> 00:28:53.119
- I'll wait.
- Yeah.

00:29:22.519 --> 00:29:23.440
Where'd you get hurt?

00:29:24.359 --> 00:29:25.079
My knee.

00:29:25.960 --> 00:29:27.400
Roll up your pant leg.

00:29:33.759 --> 00:29:34.880
You scraped it open.

00:29:36.079 --> 00:29:36.640
Jiang Ting.

00:29:37.880 --> 00:29:38.960
Let me take you back.

00:29:39.480 --> 00:29:40.039
No.

00:29:40.519 --> 00:29:42.000
That's an open wound.

00:29:42.440 --> 00:29:44.359
It'll get infected down here.

00:30:08.519 --> 00:30:09.160
It's okay.

00:30:17.920 --> 00:30:18.480
You good?

00:30:19.160 --> 00:30:20.599
I'm fine. I can keep going.

00:30:22.559 --> 00:30:23.200
Mr. Gu.

00:30:23.759 --> 00:30:25.519
Which way now?

00:30:27.160 --> 00:30:29.000
I've never met a kid this stubborn.

00:30:31.359 --> 00:30:32.799
In a place like this,

00:30:34.720 --> 00:30:36.200
when people lose their bearings,

00:30:36.359 --> 00:30:37.599
especially when nervous,

00:30:38.000 --> 00:30:39.559
they usually choose right.

00:30:43.200 --> 00:30:44.079
Let's take a chance.

00:30:44.839 --> 00:30:45.559
Go right.

00:30:48.480 --> 00:30:48.880
Okay.

00:31:17.000 --> 00:31:17.599
Tired?

00:31:22.039 --> 00:31:22.599
Let's rest.

00:31:29.680 --> 00:31:30.160
Here.

00:31:30.839 --> 00:31:31.440
Hold this.

00:31:41.640 --> 00:31:42.200
Come sit.

00:31:44.200 --> 00:31:44.680
Easy.

00:32:02.240 --> 00:32:02.960
Leg hurt?

00:32:04.440 --> 00:32:05.200
No.

00:32:21.160 --> 00:32:21.880
Have some water.

00:32:23.480 --> 00:32:24.039
Thanks.

00:32:37.359 --> 00:32:38.839
Have a banana. Keep your strength up.

00:32:43.240 --> 00:32:44.599
Want half, Mr. Gu?

00:32:44.799 --> 00:32:45.240
No.

00:33:01.720 --> 00:33:02.440
I'm getting old.

00:33:03.839 --> 00:33:05.599
I didn't feel tired walking.

00:33:06.759 --> 00:33:07.640
But once I sat down,

00:33:09.559 --> 00:33:10.359
it hit me.

00:33:11.440 --> 00:33:11.960
Ting.

00:33:13.000 --> 00:33:13.759
Today,

00:33:14.400 --> 00:33:15.880
let's head back and rest.

00:33:16.559 --> 00:33:18.519
We'll come back when we're fresh.

00:33:18.720 --> 00:33:19.279
Okay?

00:33:22.079 --> 00:33:23.640
You're just trying to send me home.

00:33:25.519 --> 00:33:26.400
I'm tired.

00:33:38.480 --> 00:33:39.599
Su Lin!

00:33:40.359 --> 00:33:41.359
Su Lin!

00:33:41.839 --> 00:33:43.640
Su Lin! Are you here?

00:33:44.079 --> 00:33:45.279
Su Lin!

00:34:11.039 --> 00:34:11.960
Fishing line.

00:34:17.119 --> 00:34:18.199
We're out of line.

00:34:20.960 --> 00:34:21.880
Fishing line.

00:34:39.039 --> 00:34:39.440
Let's go.

00:34:49.320 --> 00:34:51.240
(The Little Mermaid)

00:35:40.280 --> 00:35:41.360
Another spool.

00:35:41.840 --> 00:35:42.320
Okay.

00:35:50.199 --> 00:35:51.159
We're out of line.

00:35:54.840 --> 00:35:56.079
That's it for today.

00:36:14.600 --> 00:36:19.360
(The Little Mermaid)

00:36:20.480 --> 00:36:21.400
Little Mermaid.

00:36:23.119 --> 00:36:24.679
My entrance exam is coming up.

00:36:28.520 --> 00:36:32.800
(The Little Mermaid)

00:37:15.039 --> 00:37:15.639
Jiang Ting.

00:37:16.400 --> 00:37:17.199
There's a door.

00:37:17.599 --> 00:37:18.519
I'll take a look.

00:37:18.960 --> 00:37:20.079
I'll come too.

00:37:20.639 --> 00:37:21.239
Come on.

00:37:21.480 --> 00:37:21.880
Come.

00:37:36.079 --> 00:37:37.119
I'm going in.

00:37:37.320 --> 00:37:38.159
Wait here.

00:37:47.519 --> 00:37:49.199
What's that smell?

00:37:49.440 --> 00:37:50.280
Don't come in.

00:38:24.400 --> 00:38:25.000
No.

00:38:26.480 --> 00:38:27.559
Looks deep.

00:38:35.719 --> 00:38:36.559
Stay right there.

00:38:45.880 --> 00:38:46.400
Let's go.

00:38:48.800 --> 00:38:49.320
Going back.

00:38:55.960 --> 00:38:56.840
What's that?

00:38:58.800 --> 00:38:59.639
Mr. Gu, look.

00:39:09.239 --> 00:39:10.320
Careful, Mr. Gu.

00:39:11.239 --> 00:39:11.920
Shine it here.

00:39:32.599 --> 00:39:34.440
You can't wear that to school, right?

00:39:35.280 --> 00:39:36.719
We usually wear uniforms.

00:39:39.760 --> 00:39:40.840
Let's go back up.

00:39:59.320 --> 00:40:00.559
Why's the manhole closed?

00:40:01.880 --> 00:40:02.400
It's okay.

00:40:03.159 --> 00:40:05.719
Someone probably put the cover back.

00:40:05.880 --> 00:40:06.719
I can push it open.

00:40:14.440 --> 00:40:15.159
Easy.

00:40:21.559 --> 00:40:22.679
Careful, Mr. Gu.

00:40:34.920 --> 00:40:35.920
What is it?

00:40:36.400 --> 00:40:37.679
Something's blocking it.

00:40:37.719 --> 00:40:38.440
It's okay.

00:40:47.880 --> 00:40:48.639
Mr. Gu.

00:40:49.480 --> 00:40:51.000
What do we do?

00:40:51.360 --> 00:40:52.039
Jiang Ting.

00:40:52.559 --> 00:40:53.239
Don't be scared.

00:40:54.079 --> 00:40:55.440
I'll get you out.

00:40:56.119 --> 00:40:57.039
Help!

00:40:57.639 --> 00:40:58.679
Anyone there?

00:40:59.039 --> 00:41:00.519
Can anyone hear me?

00:41:01.400 --> 00:41:02.679
Help!

00:41:04.440 --> 00:41:06.360
Can anyone up there hear me?

00:41:07.480 --> 00:41:09.519
We're trapped down here!

00:41:10.480 --> 00:41:12.840
We're trapped in the sewer!

00:41:14.079 --> 00:41:14.760
Mr. Gu.

00:41:15.880 --> 00:41:17.519
Flashlight's almost dead.

00:41:17.800 --> 00:41:18.639
Don't be scared.

00:41:30.840 --> 00:41:31.440
Mr. Gu.

00:41:31.920 --> 00:41:32.559
Mr. Gu.

00:41:34.160 --> 00:41:36.680
=Ren Yu=
(Next Time...)

00:41:38.000 --> 00:41:39.120
If something happens,

00:41:39.120 --> 00:41:40.000
how would they cope?

00:41:40.000 --> 00:41:40.719
Ma Na.

00:41:42.920 --> 00:41:43.599
Mom.

00:41:43.639 --> 00:41:44.920
They did it on purpose.

00:41:45.000 --> 00:41:46.599
They shut the manhole

00:41:46.800 --> 00:41:48.800
and piled bricks on top.

00:41:49.039 --> 00:41:50.440
That's attempted murder.

00:41:50.559 --> 00:41:51.280
We need to check.

00:41:51.360 --> 00:41:52.080
(Police)

00:41:52.080 --> 00:41:53.080
(Chaobei Police Bureau)

00:41:53.760 --> 00:41:55.440
Ma Dongchen, listen to me.

00:41:55.800 --> 00:41:57.360
I'll never believe you again.

00:41:57.840 --> 00:41:59.639
And I'm never going home.

00:42:00.079 --> 00:42:01.519
I'm jumping.

00:42:01.559 --> 00:42:02.000
Na, don't!

00:42:02.000 --> 00:42:03.000
You'll regret it forever!

00:42:06.880 --> 00:42:07.519
Captain Wang.

00:42:07.679 --> 00:42:08.400
We found a body.

00:42:30.600 --> 00:42:33.360
♪When a♪

00:42:33.360 --> 00:42:37.840
♪Nameless little flower trembles♪

00:42:37.840 --> 00:42:42.320
♪And lifts its face to the sun♪

00:42:42.320 --> 00:42:47.360
♪In that moment♪

00:42:47.360 --> 00:42:50.280
♪I gaze at♪

00:42:50.280 --> 00:42:54.560
♪Every unfamiliar light♪

00:42:54.560 --> 00:42:58.920
♪Only starlight keeps on shining♪

00:42:58.920 --> 00:43:04.040
♪Warming me♪

00:43:04.040 --> 00:43:06.760
♪Let♪

00:43:06.760 --> 00:43:11.000
♪Every laugh and every tear pass by♪

00:43:11.000 --> 00:43:14.200
♪Then bloom out of the dust♪

00:43:14.200 --> 00:43:20.880
♪Like flowers reaching for the sun♪

00:43:20.880 --> 00:43:24.120
♪Everyone♪

00:43:24.120 --> 00:43:28.760
♪Has walked a winding road♪

00:43:28.760 --> 00:43:31.880
♪It's okay. Every scar♪

00:43:31.880 --> 00:43:38.160
♪Will heal someday♪

00:43:38.160 --> 00:43:41.040
♪When the wind blows♪

00:43:41.040 --> 00:43:45.160
♪Hear me tell what's in my heart♪

00:43:45.160 --> 00:43:49.920
♪Give me a safe, dreamlike♪

00:43:49.920 --> 00:43:55.120
♪Little corner♪

00:43:55.120 --> 00:43:58.040
♪Go chase it♪

00:43:58.040 --> 00:44:02.280
♪Run through the pouring rain♪

00:44:02.280 --> 00:44:06.840
♪Clear skies are up ahead♪

00:44:06.840 --> 00:44:12.480
♪Waiting for me♪

00:44:33.320 --> 00:44:36.240
♪When the sunlight♪

00:44:36.240 --> 00:44:40.320
♪Traces every dream in light♪

00:44:40.320 --> 00:44:46.840
♪I gently close my hand around that♪

00:44:46.840 --> 00:44:50.240
♪Warmth♪